OL,3,ASpain transport minister says he won't
OL,4,Aresign over high-speed rail disaster
OL,5,
OL,6,FThe transport minister has been facing
OL,7,Fcalls to step down in the aftermath of
OL,8,Fthe tragedy, including from political
OL,9,Frivals, a trade union and demonstrators
OL,10,Fwho protested outside the transport
OL,11,Fministry on Wednesday night.
